  <section id="vosstanovlenie">
    <h2>Recovery</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Wound care: keep the wound clean and dry until the stitches are removed; washing the head is allowed a few days after stitch removal; hair colouring — not earlier than 2–3 months.</li>
      <li>If movement or speech problems remain after trauma or stroke, rehabilitation continues after cranioplasty.</li>
      <li>Contact sports and heavy exertion — only in agreement with the surgeon.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

